(5746270, 835288, 40490, '<td valign="top">I wish the reds was brighter and more intense, so it looked like RED instead of this ... redish... darker.... color :/<br/> <br/>Awesome idea, though :D</td>', 'I wish the reds was brighter and more intense, so it looked like RED instead of this ... redish... darker.... color :/ Awesome idea, though :D', '2009-11-30 00:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746275, 836162, 40490, '<td valign="top">That''s an amazing example of short depth of field. Did you try it with a bit of a broader D.O.F? Perhaps one where all the balls are sharper, even sharpest? This would seem fun to play with various D.O.F''s.<br/> <br/>As it stands, though, the red ball could be a bit sharper :/</td>', 'That''s an amazing example of short depth of field. Did you try it with a bit of a broader D.O.F? Perhaps one where all the balls are sharper, even sharpest? This would seem fun to play with various D.O.F''s. As it stands, though, the red ball could be a bit sharper :/', '2009-11-30 00:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
