(5746756, 835742, 96751, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t meet the challenge for me, but is a fantastic shot.  Love the bokeh and the mood, and the chicken eye seals the deal.</td>', 'This doesn''t meet the challenge for me, but is a fantastic shot.  Love the bokeh and the mood, and the chicken eye seals the deal.', '2009-11-30 12:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
