(5746851, 835948, 83313, '<td valign="top">Always at least one splash shot and one wine glass per challenge, right? Good is good, however. I suppose if I start doing them myself, I can raise my average.</td>', 'Always at least one splash shot and one wine glass per challenge, right? Good is good, however. I suppose if I start doing them myself, I can raise my average.', '2009-11-30 13:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
