(5746856, 836053, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can''t quite see this as polka dots, but it''s an interesting and well captured scene nonetheless.</td>', 'Can''t quite see this as polka dots, but it''s an interesting and well captured scene nonetheless.', '2009-11-30 13:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
