(5746862, 836181, 83313, '<td valign="top">That was kinda my own idea, but lacking a suitable female model, I didn''t think anyone wanted to see my fat male butt in polka dot undies. This could be an arm, however. Extra pointage for making me stop to think about what this really is.</td>', 'That was kinda my own idea, but lacking a suitable female model, I didn''t think anyone wanted to see my fat male butt in polka dot undies. This could be an arm, however. Extra pointage for making me stop to think about what this really is.', '2009-11-30 13:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
