(5746868, 836119, 83313, '<td valign="top">Coming off to me as heavily backlit and flat looking, I''m afraid. Perhaps some adjustments (such as curves, saturation, contrast) could punch it up a bit but I am not really sure.</td>', 'Coming off to me as heavily backlit and flat looking, I''m afraid. Perhaps some adjustments (such as curves, saturation, contrast) could punch it up a bit but I am not really sure.', '2009-11-30 13:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
