(5751784, 835893, 73348, '<td valign="top">I like the compositon, but the reflection in her eyes is big and distracting.</td>', 'I like the compositon, but the reflection in her eyes is big and distracting.', '2009-12-03 03:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751851, 836181, 11771, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2009-12-03 05:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751852, 836053, 11771, '<td valign="top">AWSOME PHOTO !</td>', 'AWSOME PHOTO !', '2009-12-03 05:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751942, 836196, 43463, '<td valign="top">Lighting is great and the model''s expression is just priceless! The composition just invokes the style of some of the 1950''s fashion ads. The pose, the colors and the model''s expression is fun and has an offbeat whimsical charm. Wonderful work in this composition (9) - one of my top 11!</td>', 'Lighting is great and the model''s expression is just priceless! The composition just invokes the style of some of the 1950''s fashion ads. The pose, the colors and the model''s expression is fun and has an offbeat whimsical charm. Wonderful work in this composition (9) - one of my top 11!', '2009-12-03 08:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751953, 836150, 43463, '<td valign="top">The man in black meets the invisible woman donning her polka dot best. There is just something fun, offbeat and mysterious about this composition at the same time. Tis really would have put a mysterious spin &amp; strengthened the invisible woman concept if you had stuffed the right sleeve to make it appear that an arm was filling it (I think it would definately make viewer do a double take) The background invokes an errie cloudy overcast day but there seems to be some odd artifacting or jagged patches that occur right over where the head of the ''woman'' should be and it is distracting to the eye. Lighting is good and the contrasting colors of black and white really pop off the page. I think you could have easily presented this photo without the border for I feel it really doesn''t add anything to the composition. Nonetheless, a very eye-catching image and good work:-)</td>', 'The man in black meets the invisible woman donning her polka dot best. There is just something fun, offbeat and mysterious about this composition at the same time. Tis really would have put a mysterious spin & strengthened the invisible woman concept if you had stuffed the right sleeve to make it appear that an arm was filling it (I think it would definately make viewer do a double take) The background invokes an errie cloudy overcast day but there seems to be some odd artifacting or jagged patches that occur right over where the head of the ''woman'' should be and it is distracting to the eye. Lighting is good and the contrasting colors of black and white really pop off the page. I think you could have easily presented this photo without the border for I feel it really doesn''t add anything to the composition. Nonetheless, a very eye-catching image and good work:-)', '2009-12-03 08:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751986, 836051, 111167, '<td valign="top">Good concept!</td>', 'Good concept!', '2009-12-03 09:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5752498, 836586, 99708, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Unfortunately, for me, there was too much OOF and it bothered my eyes.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Unfortunately, for me, there was too much OOF and it bothered my eyes.', '2009-12-03 15:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5752734, 836210, 101318, '<td valign="top">Great Idea. For consistency, should the man have a white coat? Just a thought</td>', 'Great Idea. For consistency, should the man have a white coat? Just a thought', '2009-12-03 17:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753009, 836038, 554, '<td valign="top">That''s a very nice job of placing the dots. Thanks for taking the time to produce a great photo. Well lit too.</td>', 'That''s a very nice job of placing the dots. Thanks for taking the time to produce a great photo. Well lit too.', '2009-12-03 20:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5753035, 836248, 554, '<td valign="top">The bag with fish adds great interest to this photo...nice pic.</td>', 'The bag with fish adds great interest to this photo...nice pic.', '2009-12-03 20:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
