(5754088, 836474, 62187, '<td valign="top">Don''t you think he''ll look kinda funny in that thing? I think it would look better on you. };&gt;) Clearly, a well lit, composed and focused photo.</td>', 'Don''t you think he''ll look kinda funny in that thing? I think it would look better on you. };>) Clearly, a well lit, composed and focused photo.', '2009-12-04 11:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
