(5756465, 836008, 30454, '<td valign="top">Good concept, and choice of B/W color. Three bars in the front is little too much. Good luck.</td>', 'Good concept, and choice of B/W color. Three bars in the front is little too much. Good luck.', '2009-12-06 02:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756565, 836367, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice job at capturing a gloomy mood, yet with color. The rain really makes this shot.</td>', 'Nice job at capturing a gloomy mood, yet with color. The rain really makes this shot.', '2009-12-06 08:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756566, 835893, 12674, '<td valign="top">Terrific perspective, cute subject, and those dark eyes really become part of the dots.</td>', 'Terrific perspective, cute subject, and those dark eyes really become part of the dots.', '2009-12-06 08:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756567, 836210, 12674, '<td valign="top">A funny, really well staged and composed shot!  One of my favorites.</td>', 'A funny, really well staged and composed shot!  One of my favorites.', '2009-12-06 08:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756568, 836080, 12674, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pose, composition and color - excellent shot!</td>', 'Wonderful pose, composition and color - excellent shot!', '2009-12-06 08:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756569, 836506, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great shot, cute subjects!</td>', 'Great shot, cute subjects!', '2009-12-06 08:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756570, 836248, 12674, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding shot, one of my favorites! The subject, the pose, the background, and the black and white all give it an innocent and genuine feel.</td>', 'This is an outstanding shot, one of my favorites! The subject, the pose, the background, and the black and white all give it an innocent and genuine feel.', '2009-12-06 08:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756571, 835627, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp bokeh - good idea!</td>', 'Nice sharp bokeh - good idea!', '2009-12-06 08:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756814, 836210, 31456, '<td valign="top">I love it - my only 10.</td>', 'I love it - my only 10.', '2009-12-06 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756815, 836589, 31456, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The only thing that''s "not quite right" to me is the pattern itself - the white on black makes it look like I''m seeing through him, but then I realize I''m not seeing through him. So it''s a bit weird, and maybe a light gray would''ve made it better. 9</td>', 'I really like this. The only thing that''s "not quite right" to me is the pattern itself - the white on black makes it look like I''m seeing through him, but then I realize I''m not seeing through him. So it''s a bit weird, and maybe a light gray would''ve made it better. 9', '2009-12-06 13:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756817, 836367, 31456, '<td valign="top">Love the tight crop, bright pinks, and dull background. I feel she kind of fades into the background a bit too much though, with the gray shirt. 9</td>', 'Love the tight crop, bright pinks, and dull background. I feel she kind of fades into the background a bit too much though, with the gray shirt. 9', '2009-12-06 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756819, 836497, 31456, '<td valign="top">Well shot, great detail, good tones, but it''s not a "wow!" shot. 8</td>', 'Well shot, great detail, good tones, but it''s not a "wow!" shot. 8', '2009-12-06 13:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756822, 835592, 31456, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors and off-center composition. However, her expression seems a bit weird to me, and I would have liked a bright background color more. Minor things, though, so it''s an 8</td>', 'I like the bright colors and off-center composition. However, her expression seems a bit weird to me, and I would have liked a bright background color more. Minor things, though, so it''s an 8', '2009-12-06 13:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756823, 836170, 31456, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, but I like the expressions and the softness. 8</td>', 'A bit dark, but I like the expressions and the softness. 8', '2009-12-06 13:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756825, 836228, 31456, '<td valign="top">Good tones, but it''s a bit <i>too </i>far from the center. The pink really pops! 8</td>', 'Good tones, but it''s a bit too far from the center. The pink really pops! 8', '2009-12-06 13:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756827, 836182, 31456, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, but I feel you haven''t focused enough on the polkadottedness. 7</td>', 'I love the colors, but I feel you haven''t focused enough on the polkadottedness. 7', '2009-12-06 13:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756834, 835893, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl and very creative composition. Love the focus and DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful girl and very creative composition. Love the focus and DOF.', '2009-12-06 13:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756836, 835742, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, but it doesn''t seem right for this challenge.</td>', 'Love the shot, but it doesn''t seem right for this challenge.', '2009-12-06 13:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756837, 836283, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail.</td>', 'Beautiful detail.', '2009-12-06 13:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756838, 836478, 108982, '<td valign="top">I am usually not a negative critic however, the pose in your photo is excessivley unflattering to the otherwise attractive model.  Instead of alluring and eyecatching, I would expect a pose like this on CSI after just finding a haphazardly dumped body in the woods.  Too many other distractions in the greenery, snow, dead trees behind.  i''ve seen this woman used before and very well I might add but this seemed rushed and unthoughtful.  Sorry, I hope this is taken in the spirit intended.</td>', 'I am usually not a negative critic however, the pose in your photo is excessivley unflattering to the otherwise attractive model.  Instead of alluring and eyecatching, I would expect a pose like this on CSI after just finding a haphazardly dumped body in the woods.  Too many other distractions in the greenery, snow, dead trees behind.  i''ve seen this woman used before and very well I might add but this seemed rushed and unthoughtful.  Sorry, I hope this is taken in the spirit intended.', '2009-12-06 13:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756840, 835288, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. It seems like it could benefit from a little more brightness. The whites are a tad too gray.</td>', 'Nice composition. It seems like it could benefit from a little more brightness. The whites are a tad too gray.', '2009-12-06 13:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756842, 836367, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and perfect for the challenge. I think it would be more appealing if you smoothed out the tones on the knees.</td>', 'Nice idea and perfect for the challenge. I think it would be more appealing if you smoothed out the tones on the knees.', '2009-12-06 13:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756843, 836020, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. Definitely a contender.</td>', 'Very dramatic. Definitely a contender.', '2009-12-06 13:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756846, 836470, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model and excellent composition. The lighting seems a little dull.</td>', 'Very pretty model and excellent composition. The lighting seems a little dull.', '2009-12-06 13:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756848, 836210, 66384, '<td valign="top">Ah, another wonderful shot of the Umbrella Man. Love it.</td>', 'Ah, another wonderful shot of the Umbrella Man. Love it.', '2009-12-06 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756856, 836268, 31456, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness and colors, but the tilt is unpleasant to me, and it''s not really too original. 7</td>', 'I like the sharpness and colors, but the tilt is unpleasant to me, and it''s not really too original. 7', '2009-12-06 14:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756858, 836241, 31456, '<td valign="top">The DOF is a bit too shallow here, with the bow a bit soft. Also, not fond of the centered composition. Great pattern and good random-looking arrangement of buttons. The green adds a nice contrast.</td>', 'The DOF is a bit too shallow here, with the bow a bit soft. Also, not fond of the centered composition. Great pattern and good random-looking arrangement of buttons. The green adds a nice contrast.', '2009-12-06 14:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756859, 836026, 31456, '<td valign="top">This is completely unoriginal, but it''s well shot. A bit soft inside the glasses, but I''m assuming you couldn''t really do anything about that.</td>', 'This is completely unoriginal, but it''s well shot. A bit soft inside the glasses, but I''m assuming you couldn''t really do anything about that.', '2009-12-06 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756860, 836248, 31456, '<td valign="top">Cute, but I''m not liking the centered composition. Very nice tones, very nostalgic.<br/> <br/>ETA: I gave this a 7. Congrats on your placement.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-07 06:05:22.</i></td>', 'Cute, but I''m not liking the centered composition. Very nice tones, very nostalgic. ETA: I gave this a 7. Congrats on your placement.', '2009-12-06 14:15:37.000000', '2009-12-07 06:05:22.000000', 1),
(5756862, 836135, 31456, '<td valign="top">Great studio shot, with good tones and sharpness. A bit too centered, and not enough of a "wow" factor. Still, 7</td>', 'Great studio shot, with good tones and sharpness. A bit too centered, and not enough of a "wow" factor. Still, 7', '2009-12-06 14:16:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5756863, 835545, 31456, '<td valign="top">This is like something out of "I, Robot." Nice, but nothing too special. Good angle.</td>', 'This is like something out of "I, Robot." Nice, but nothing too special. Good angle.', '2009-12-06 14:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756957, 836248, 102278, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I really like the chest down crop and various elements of the shot, such as the goldfish, the texture of the wall and the angle of the leg, combine to make the image really fascinating. There''s a great classic feel to it and a wonderful sense of narrative. My pick for the Blue. 10.</td>', 'Great composition. I really like the chest down crop and various elements of the shot, such as the goldfish, the texture of the wall and the angle of the leg, combine to make the image really fascinating. There''s a great classic feel to it and a wonderful sense of narrative. My pick for the Blue. 10.', '2009-12-06 15:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756959, 836589, 102278, '<td valign="top">A great success.  In my top three of the challenge. 9</td>', 'A great success.  In my top three of the challenge. 9', '2009-12-06 15:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756960, 836210, 102278, '<td valign="top">Great fun image. Good composition and processing.  In my top three of the challenge. 9</td>', 'Great fun image. Good composition and processing.  In my top three of the challenge. 9', '2009-12-06 15:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756961, 836157, 102278, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition.  In my top four of the challenge. 9</td>', 'Wonderful composition.  In my top four of the challenge. 9', '2009-12-06 15:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756962, 836170, 102278, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. Full of character of the girls. 8</td>', 'Lovely portrait. Full of character of the girls. 8', '2009-12-06 15:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757023, 836080, 99506, '<td valign="top">how can I not give this a good score lol... nice composition and skin processing</td>', 'how can I not give this a good score lol... nice composition and skin processing', '2009-12-06 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757026, 836255, 99506, '<td valign="top">beautiful title and interpretation of the challenge</td>', 'beautiful title and interpretation of the challenge', '2009-12-06 17:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757027, 836008, 99506, '<td valign="top">magical shot</td>', 'magical shot', '2009-12-06 17:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757028, 836328, 99506, '<td valign="top">omg this reminds me of a horror film lol</td>', 'omg this reminds me of a horror film lol', '2009-12-06 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757030, 836135, 99506, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W was a very good choice here in my opinion</td>', 'B&W was a very good choice here in my opinion', '2009-12-06 17:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757032, 835571, 99506, '<td valign="top">nice use of shallow dof to good affect</td>', 'nice use of shallow dof to good affect', '2009-12-06 17:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757033, 836041, 99506, '<td valign="top">this look just a bit dangerous to me</td>', 'this look just a bit dangerous to me', '2009-12-06 17:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757034, 835742, 99506, '<td valign="top">nice idea henny penny...</td>', 'nice idea henny penny...', '2009-12-06 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757035, 836589, 99506, '<td valign="top">nice affect</td>', 'nice affect', '2009-12-06 17:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757037, 836038, 99506, '<td valign="top">Very funny idea well executed. My only comment is that I think I would have liked it better if you had used white dots only but thats just my opinon.</td>', 'Very funny idea well executed. My only comment is that I think I would have liked it better if you had used white dots only but thats just my opinon.', '2009-12-06 17:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757039, 836210, 99506, '<td valign="top">Love this shot and love the title. It''s a picture one could live with, interesting yet easy on the eye.</td>', 'Love this shot and love the title. It''s a picture one could live with, interesting yet easy on the eye.', '2009-12-06 17:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757041, 835592, 99506, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good crisp shot just not keen on the catch lights</td>', 'nice idea, good crisp shot just not keen on the catch lights', '2009-12-06 17:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757044, 836157, 99506, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot</td>', 'very interesting shot', '2009-12-06 17:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757049, 836574, 99506, '<td valign="top">outstanding shot that draws you in. great work</td>', 'outstanding shot that draws you in. great work', '2009-12-06 17:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757184, 836367, 40490, '<td valign="top">just a trifle wider DOF, get the gal in focus and it would have been an amazing shot! 6 (I think I would have 7''d it, but that softness on the person is just enough for me to take it away from snapshot and to a very well done piece of art)</td>', 'just a trifle wider DOF, get the gal in focus and it would have been an amazing shot! 6 (I think I would have 7''d it, but that softness on the person is just enough for me to take it away from snapshot and to a very well done piece of art)', '2009-12-06 19:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757337, 836135, 34938, '<td valign="top">the winner...9</td>', 'the winner...9', '2009-12-06 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757338, 836210, 34938, '<td valign="top">Has to be Cooley...10 from me</td>', 'Has to be Cooley...10 from me', '2009-12-06 21:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757341, 836196, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love the quirkiness of this...great eyes and smile...9</td>', 'I love the quirkiness of this...great eyes and smile...9', '2009-12-06 21:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757342, 836268, 34938, '<td valign="top">nicely lit...blue tones are great</td>', 'nicely lit...blue tones are great', '2009-12-06 21:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757344, 836248, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love the quirkiness of this...I am sure the dpc voters won''t appreciate this, but I love it 9</td>', 'I love the quirkiness of this...I am sure the dpc voters won''t appreciate this, but I love it 9', '2009-12-06 21:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757345, 836279, 34938, '<td valign="top">gorgeous...lovely tones and light, great edit 8</td>', 'gorgeous...lovely tones and light, great edit 8', '2009-12-06 21:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757346, 836474, 34938, '<td valign="top">If he doesn''t, he''s blind ;)  Great lighting</td>', 'If he doesn''t, he''s blind ;)  Great lighting', '2009-12-06 21:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757349, 836589, 34938, '<td valign="top">Very creative, great edit 8</td>', 'Very creative, great edit 8', '2009-12-06 21:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757352, 836485, 31456, '<td valign="top">Good use of polka dots, but it''s not a very well-taken image. Seems like either noise, noise reduction, or motion blur (or all three?) is making it a bit soft, and it seems oversharpened. Also, it looks like you sharpened after adding the border, creating a white halo.</td>', 'Good use of polka dots, but it''s not a very well-taken image. Seems like either noise, noise reduction, or motion blur (or all three?) is making it a bit soft, and it seems oversharpened. Also, it looks like you sharpened after adding the border, creating a white halo.', '2009-12-06 21:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757354, 836505, 31456, '<td valign="top">Well, there''s polka dots and plenty of color and it''s pretty sharp... but I''m not sure I understand what''s going on in the image. Also, the light seems uneven, like on-camera flash.</td>', 'Well, there''s polka dots and plenty of color and it''s pretty sharp... but I''m not sure I understand what''s going on in the image. Also, the light seems uneven, like on-camera flash.', '2009-12-06 21:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757358, 836020, 31456, '<td valign="top">The dots seem too manufactured here - I think of printed or sewn dots (or dots on an animal) when I think of polka dots, not so much lighting through holes. That''s personal preference, I know, but that''s how voting goes. The DOF is a bit shallow, with the blurry nose becoming a bit of a distraction. Good composition. Perhaps color would''ve worked better to make it a bit more interesting?</td>', 'The dots seem too manufactured here - I think of printed or sewn dots (or dots on an animal) when I think of polka dots, not so much lighting through holes. That''s personal preference, I know, but that''s how voting goes. The DOF is a bit shallow, with the blurry nose becoming a bit of a distraction. Good composition. Perhaps color would''ve worked better to make it a bit more interesting?', '2009-12-06 21:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757359, 836255, 31456, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I''m not seeing this as polka dots. The white dots look more like sensor noise with a Threshold filter applied to the area.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I''m not seeing this as polka dots. The white dots look more like sensor noise with a Threshold filter applied to the area.', '2009-12-06 21:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757361, 835742, 31456, '<td valign="top">I see blotches in the sky, and stripes on the bird... but no polka dots. Well taken image, very weird (in a good way) composition.</td>', 'I see blotches in the sky, and stripes on the bird... but no polka dots. Well taken image, very weird (in a good way) composition.', '2009-12-06 21:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757366, 836061, 31456, '<td valign="top">Well this is a different take. I like what you''ve done with the bigger (metropolitan?) areas. A bit far from regular photography, and a bit monochromatic as well.</td>', 'Well this is a different take. I like what you''ve done with the bigger (metropolitan?) areas. A bit far from regular photography, and a bit monochromatic as well.', '2009-12-06 21:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757372, 836137, 31456, '<td valign="top">Hmm, bokeh polka dots. I tend to think of polka dots as more on a fabric or other surface rather than in mid-air, but these seem to create their own surface so that makes it sort-of okay to me (sorry, I''m kind of anal when it comes to these). Reminds me of my Twisted II entry. Good concept, but a bit uninteresting (more interesting than mine though).</td>', 'Hmm, bokeh polka dots. I tend to think of polka dots as more on a fabric or other surface rather than in mid-air, but these seem to create their own surface so that makes it sort-of okay to me (sorry, I''m kind of anal when it comes to these). Reminds me of my Twisted II entry. Good concept, but a bit uninteresting (more interesting than mine though).', '2009-12-06 21:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757374, 836501, 31456, '<td valign="top">I can''t really see these as polka dots because of all the intersecting lines and the lack of roundness. Nice impressionism (it''s impressionism, right?), though the right side is a bit too sharp.</td>', 'I can''t really see these as polka dots because of all the intersecting lines and the lack of roundness. Nice impressionism (it''s impressionism, right?), though the right side is a bit too sharp.', '2009-12-06 21:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757375, 836315, 31456, '<td valign="top">Nice, but seems a bit too set up and the "manufactured" polka dots don''t do it for me. I like how it''s desaturated, that''s how dark places really look.</td>', 'Nice, but seems a bit too set up and the "manufactured" polka dots don''t do it for me. I like how it''s desaturated, that''s how dark places really look.', '2009-12-06 21:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757377, 836494, 31456, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but they''re a bit widely/unevenly spaced for polka dots. Also, there''s some motion blur on the bottom.</td>', 'Great idea, but they''re a bit widely/unevenly spaced for polka dots. Also, there''s some motion blur on the bottom.', '2009-12-06 21:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757378, 835571, 31456, '<td valign="top">Well this is something I haven''t seen so far in this challenge. Nice DOF, but a bit bland.</td>', 'Well this is something I haven''t seen so far in this challenge. Nice DOF, but a bit bland.', '2009-12-06 21:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757382, 836157, 31456, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool, but a bit of a shoehorn IMO. It''s like saying "do a landscape," and I shoot an image in which half is a sexy girl in a car, and half is a mirror in which you see a pretty bland landscape that''s off to the side.</td>', 'This is pretty cool, but a bit of a shoehorn IMO. It''s like saying "do a landscape," and I shoot an image in which half is a sexy girl in a car, and half is a mirror in which you see a pretty bland landscape that''s off to the side.', '2009-12-06 21:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757383, 836291, 31456, '<td valign="top">Nice, but could''ve been shot in a way that made it more interesting.</td>', 'Nice, but could''ve been shot in a way that made it more interesting.', '2009-12-06 21:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757384, 836190, 31456, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but I''m used to seeing polka dots as an even pattern throughout rather than placed in lines and circles. DOF is a bit too shallow. Good tones, and good use of the border.</td>', 'Good concept, but I''m used to seeing polka dots as an even pattern throughout rather than placed in lines and circles. DOF is a bit too shallow. Good tones, and good use of the border.', '2009-12-06 21:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757385, 836313, 31456, '<td valign="top">Cute, but a bit too light. I think the B&amp;W works really well here.</td>', 'Cute, but a bit too light. I think the B&W works really well here.', '2009-12-06 21:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757388, 835627, 31456, '<td valign="top">Ah, bokeh polka dots again. I like these abstract-looking images, but in a different context... they''re just not as interesting as the other entries.</td>', 'Ah, bokeh polka dots again. I like these abstract-looking images, but in a different context... they''re just not as interesting as the other entries.', '2009-12-06 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757389, 836119, 31456, '<td valign="top">Nice dots! Needs a bit more contrast, and a bit more saturation.</td>', 'Nice dots! Needs a bit more contrast, and a bit more saturation.', '2009-12-06 21:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757391, 836146, 31456, '<td valign="top">Not polka dotty enough in my opinion. They''re more of blobs. Also, could use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Not polka dotty enough in my opinion. They''re more of blobs. Also, could use a bit more contrast.', '2009-12-06 21:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757393, 836483, 31456, '<td valign="top">Good find, but these look more like scales on a fish than polka dots... they''re touching too much. Good, strong colors. I would''ve liked it more with the camera tilted upwards a bit.</td>', 'Good find, but these look more like scales on a fish than polka dots... they''re touching too much. Good, strong colors. I would''ve liked it more with the camera tilted upwards a bit.', '2009-12-06 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757395, 836162, 31456, '<td valign="top">This is cool, but no "wow factor." Great use of the shallow DOF. 7</td>', 'This is cool, but no "wow factor." Great use of the shallow DOF. 7', '2009-12-06 22:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757419, 836531, 31456, '<td valign="top">This is too funny. Not a huge technical achievement, but well-shot and funny. 7</td>', 'This is too funny. Not a huge technical achievement, but well-shot and funny. 7', '2009-12-06 22:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757420, 835738, 31456, '<td valign="top">Another hilarious shot! 7</td>', 'Another hilarious shot! 7', '2009-12-06 22:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757423, 835570, 31456, '<td valign="top">Great use of tilt. Needs something to really draw me in, though. 7</td>', 'Great use of tilt. Needs something to really draw me in, though. 7', '2009-12-06 22:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757424, 836150, 31456, '<td valign="top">Very original! And really good expression. The background is kind of distracting, though. And since she fills the torso of the dress, the arms end up looking weird hanging like that. 6</td>', 'Very original! And really good expression. The background is kind of distracting, though. And since she fills the torso of the dress, the arms end up looking weird hanging like that. 6', '2009-12-06 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757425, 836510, 31456, '<td valign="top">The blurriness is a bit distracting, and I think I would''ve liked hardwood flooring rather than bedsheets. Good color choices.</td>', 'The blurriness is a bit distracting, and I think I would''ve liked hardwood flooring rather than bedsheets. Good color choices.', '2009-12-06 22:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
