(5757527, 836505, 77196, '<td valign="top">For the curious, the purse is just a polka dotted purse, with some polka dotted cloth in it. The object that only <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> guessed is indeed a banana (NOT battery powered), painted white, "wings" made from pipe cleaners inserted on either side, and highlighted in orange on one side and blue on the other. I suspended it from a thread, and caught the bottom of the banana in the purse so it would stay in the desired position. Top of the shot was a bit dark to hide the thread, and yes, I used the on-camera flash (at least part of it - held my hand in front of part of it). <br/>Guess that score will teach me to be creative!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-07 00:09:42.</i></td>', 'For the curious, the purse is just a polka dotted purse, with some polka dotted cloth in it. The object that only  Yo_Spiff guessed is indeed a banana (NOT battery powered), painted white, "wings" made from pipe cleaners inserted on either side, and highlighted in orange on one side and blue on the other. I suspended it from a thread, and caught the bottom of the banana in the purse so it would stay in the desired position. Top of the shot was a bit dark to hide the thread, and yes, I used the on-camera flash (at least part of it - held my hand in front of part of it). Guess that score will teach me to be creative!', '2009-12-07 00:08:02.000000', '2009-12-07 00:09:42.000000', 0),
