(5758017, 836248, 61961, '<td valign="top">My choice for the "blue" as well.  Makes me think of Diane Arbus!  Btw, despite the sense of awkwardness in the pose, it never occurred to me this was a child.  My only criticism is that the vignette is too heavy for my taste, I wish the dress didn''t darken so much at the top.</td>', 'My choice for the "blue" as well.  Makes me think of Diane Arbus!  Btw, despite the sense of awkwardness in the pose, it never occurred to me this was a child.  My only criticism is that the vignette is too heavy for my taste, I wish the dress didn''t darken so much at the top.', '2009-12-07 11:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758021, 836470, 61961, '<td valign="top">I wish the model''s face was a bit more brightly lit, however, the emphasis *is* clearly on the polka-dots.  Very nice portrait and meets the challenge beautifully.  <br/> <br/>I wonder how many users have never heard the song "She wore an itsy-bitsy teeny-weeny yellow polka dot bikini?"</td>', 'I wish the model''s face was a bit more brightly lit, however, the emphasis *is* clearly on the polka-dots.  Very nice portrait and meets the challenge beautifully.   I wonder how many users have never heard the song "She wore an itsy-bitsy teeny-weeny yellow polka dot bikini?"', '2009-12-07 11:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
