(5758336, 836146, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot, I thought it was very intriguing! (I gave it a 9.)<br/> <br/>actually, it deserves a bluebird!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I really liked this shot, I thought it was very intriguing! (I gave it a 9.) actually, it deserves a bluebird! ', '2009-12-07 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758341, 836473, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fun shot! But then again I''m a sucker for black and blue combination (or is it brown and pink? ) :D</td>', 'I think this is a fun shot! But then again I''m a sucker for black and blue combination (or is it brown and pink? ) :D', '2009-12-07 15:29:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758344, 836501, 103142, '<td valign="top">Team suck is really helping me to appreciate the more bizarre picts. You had me staring at this one for quite awhile, trying to figure out just what I thought of it!</td>', 'Team suck is really helping me to appreciate the more bizarre picts. You had me staring at this one for quite awhile, trying to figure out just what I thought of it!', '2009-12-07 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758347, 836255, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really liked this image, and I certainly though it was close enough to fit polka-dot! I gave it a 7. And I agree, it looks like fairy lights!</td>', 'I really liked this image, and I certainly though it was close enough to fit polka-dot! I gave it a 7. And I agree, it looks like fairy lights!', '2009-12-07 15:33:27.000000', NULL, 0),
