(5758366, 836265, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok, I have absolutely no problem with the focus, and I think it''s very Norman Rockwellish! I gave it a 7. The look on his face is just perfect!</td>', 'Ok, I have absolutely no problem with the focus, and I think it''s very Norman Rockwellish! I gave it a 7. The look on his face is just perfect!', '2009-12-07 15:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758533, 836061, 90495, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many voters thought I photographed a photo. lol</td>', 'I wonder how many voters thought I photographed a photo. lol', '2009-12-07 17:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758621, 836265, 51538, '<td valign="top">Came back to read the reason for the focus...  I think that you should have put a bottle full of evil looking medicine on the bed sheets just at the focus point.  Otherwise, I do understand why you chose the focal point to be other than the boy''s face.  Just that you need something to actually be in focus... like a bottle.</td>', 'Came back to read the reason for the focus...  I think that you should have put a bottle full of evil looking medicine on the bed sheets just at the focus point.  Otherwise, I do understand why you chose the focal point to be other than the boy''s face.  Just that you need something to actually be in focus... like a bottle.', '2009-12-07 17:24:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758648, 836210, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congrats, my friend.  This is really a fun quirky take on the challenge.  So original!!!</td>', 'Congrats, my friend.  This is really a fun quirky take on the challenge.  So original!!!', '2009-12-07 17:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
