(5758657, 836182, 15711, '<td valign="top">I liked this one a lot.  Different.  Really beautiful.</td>', 'I liked this one a lot.  Different.  Really beautiful.', '2009-12-07 17:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758670, 836210, 106543, '<td valign="top">When I saw this during voting it reminded me of your photo "The Meeting", great shot as always!</td>', 'When I saw this during voting it reminded me of your photo "The Meeting", great shot as always!', '2009-12-07 17:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758718, 836501, 100831, '<td valign="top">You are just so amazingly creative. I still like this - even for polka dots. And I gave it a 7 btw.</td>', 'You are just so amazingly creative. I still like this - even for polka dots. And I gave it a 7 btw.', '2009-12-07 18:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758747, 836473, 16488, '<td valign="top">Critique Club comment.<br/> <br/>Image of patterned dots, clearly fabric from the grain of the lighter portions. A line of dots travels from one corner to another in a pleasing swoop. The image fits the challenge, if marginally.<br/> <br/>The interest of the cutouts is lost in the image. Shadows appear in the left and right corners of the non-dominant lines of dots. Without your interesting description this feature is obscured.<br/> <br/>It is a graphic presentation that could suggest tentacles...or bubbles...or just a nice pattern for home-wares. It lacks dimension overall and where dimension appears it is side-lined, relegated to the corners. In the lower right corner the dots go curving away...which could be interesting but didn\''t become a feature. I think that paying more attention to the little things would help in an image like this where every little thing plays an important role.<br/> <br/>I can understand the fun of exploring a new object with the lens. If you were to re-shoot the subject perhaps you could try playing on the gap of the top fabric from the lower, working on the dimension of the object. More "you" and less "person who designed this pattern" might bring this up a notch.<br/></td>', 'Critique Club comment. Image of patterned dots, clearly fabric from the grain of the lighter portions. A line of dots travels from one corner to another in a pleasing swoop. The image fits the challenge, if marginally. The interest of the cutouts is lost in the image. Shadows appear in the left and right corners of the non-dominant lines of dots. Without your interesting description this feature is obscured. It is a graphic presentation that could suggest tentacles...or bubbles...or just a nice pattern for home-wares. It lacks dimension overall and where dimension appears it is side-lined, relegated to the corners. In the lower right corner the dots go curving away...which could be interesting but didn\''t become a feature. I think that paying more attention to the little things would help in an image like this where every little thing plays an important role. I can understand the fun of exploring a new object with the lens. If you were to re-shoot the subject perhaps you could try playing on the gap of the top fabric from the lower, working on the dimension of the object. More "you" and less "person who designed this pattern" might bring this up a notch.', '2009-12-07 18:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758758, 836196, 8759, '<td valign="top">Foarte frumos. Felicitari<br/> <br/>Very pretty. Congrats!</td>', 'Foarte frumos. Felicitari Very pretty. Congrats!', '2009-12-07 18:58:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758777, 836210, 100727, '<td valign="top">This photo took me back to the old days.  It''s like a story in a fairytale land.</td>', 'This photo took me back to the old days.  It''s like a story in a fairytale land.', '2009-12-07 19:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758779, 836427, 100727, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot.  The colour and the bokeh are amazing.  The "polka dots" on its body are amazing.  I can feel the "3-D" of the dots!  Very good capture and processing.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot.  The colour and the bokeh are amazing.  The "polka dots" on its body are amazing.  I can feel the "3-D" of the dots!  Very good capture and processing.', '2009-12-07 19:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758814, 836427, 69008, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot of this Madagascar Giant Day Gecko. The colors in this shot are exactly as they look when you are looking at a live one. <br/> I had one for over a year. I kept him in a terrarium with a top made of screen with holes about the size of a pencil. He lived outside, and at night I would leave a light on over the cage where bugs could get in for him to eat. He tried to eat a beetle that got in, and choked on it : P</td>', 'What a beautiful shot of this Madagascar Giant Day Gecko. The colors in this shot are exactly as they look when you are looking at a live one.  I had one for over a year. I kept him in a terrarium with a top made of screen with holes about the size of a pencil. He lived outside, and at night I would leave a light on over the cage where bugs could get in for him to eat. He tried to eat a beetle that got in, and choked on it : P', '2009-12-07 19:28:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758854, 836210, 73564, '<td valign="top">Congrats! "this is wow!!" nice job!!!</td>', 'Congrats! "this is wow!!" nice job!!!', '2009-12-07 19:45:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758891, 836210, 43463, '<td valign="top">And Coley hits it out of the park!!!! Congrats on your new PB! Great work as always and like a truly crazy artist you go nuts and paste dots all over the van;-);-) I knew this would do well - and like I said, I love umbrellas (have nine different ones with different patterns and shapes:-) )</td>', 'And Coley hits it out of the park!!!! Congrats on your new PB! Great work as always and like a truly crazy artist you go nuts and paste dots all over the van;-);-) I knew this would do well - and like I said, I love umbrellas (have nine different ones with different patterns and shapes:-) )', '2009-12-07 20:08:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758896, 836080, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 10 finish! Very happy to see that this placed well, but then it is well done work:-)</td>', 'Congrats on the top 10 finish! Very happy to see that this placed well, but then it is well done work:-)', '2009-12-07 20:10:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5758899, 836574, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrads on the ribbon! This was one of my two tens I handed out. Again, excellent work!</td>', 'Congrads on the ribbon! This was one of my two tens I handed out. Again, excellent work!', '2009-12-07 20:11:33.000000', NULL, 0);
