(5765167, 836478, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I was surprised when I opened the link to see that this scored as low as it did.  Clearly the image met the challenge, so you cannot have received DNMC votes at least :)<br/> <br/>For my taste, I find that framing is a little too tight.  I would prefer to see a little more space to the left of the image as I look at it.  I do agree with some of the comments you have received already about the posing.  You model really does look a tad uncomfortable, a little like she is clinging on for dear life.<br/> <br/>Although I don''t think there is really anything wrong with the exposure, the lighting does feel a bit flat to me.<br/> <br/>Sarah</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club I was surprised when I opened the link to see that this scored as low as it did.  Clearly the image met the challenge, so you cannot have received DNMC votes at least :) For my taste, I find that framing is a little too tight.  I would prefer to see a little more space to the left of the image as I look at it.  I do agree with some of the comments you have received already about the posing.  You model really does look a tad uncomfortable, a little like she is clinging on for dear life. Although I don''t think there is really anything wrong with the exposure, the lighting does feel a bit flat to me. Sarah', '2009-12-13 05:45:41.000000', NULL, 0),
